{%- comment -%}
  Section: "Redirect" (dev name `dev-redirect`). Sends the visitor to another page.

  Why it exists (owner, 2026-10-01: "delete the Snooze home page"; "All Articles takes you simply to
  the page on Our Story that shows the blog"): Shopify cannot delete a blog's own index page
  (/blogs/news, and its /tagged/ pages) while the blog has posts, and its URL-redirect tool only
  acts on paths that would otherwise 404. So templates/blog.json renders THIS instead of a page:
  an instant redirect to the blog list on Our Story.

    * meta refresh 0  — works with scripting off; Google treats an instant meta refresh as a
                        permanent redirect, so the index drops out of search in favour of the target
    * location.replace — the same, without leaving the dead URL in the back-button history
    * a visible link  — for anything that honours neither

  NOT in the theme editor: there it shows a note instead, otherwise the editor itself would be
  thrown off the template the moment it was opened.

  No CSS or JS files: its only styling is the padding on two fallback lines (inline, below), and its
  one line of script is inline
  because it must run before anything else on the page does.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign target = section.settings.target | default: routes.root_url
-%}

{%- if request.design_mode -%}
  <div style="padding: 48px 16px; text-align: center; font-family: var(--font-body);">
    <p><strong>This page redirects</strong> visitors to <a href="{{ target }}">{{ target }}</a>.</p>
    <p>Change the destination in this section's settings, or remove the section to show the page again.</p>
  </div>
{%- else -%}
  <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url={{ target | escape }}">
  <script>window.location.replace({{ target | json }});</script>
  <p style="padding: 48px 16px; text-align: center;"><a href="{{ target }}">{{ section.settings.fallback_text | escape }}</a></p>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Redirect",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Content" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "target", "label": "Send visitors to" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "fallback_text", "label": "Link text (if the redirect is blocked)", "default": "Continue to our journal" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Redirect" }]
}
{% endschema %}
